ころ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無知が災いし、エロゲー原画の仕事を請けることに……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「エッチな絵なんて、描けない……！ぐすっ、だってわたし……わたし、まだ処女なんだもの！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"130580"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c09a1bec781bca8e6ed281afd253bcdca6a05697cc0f8d9df1adfc2d66d6ea60.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f8042cd2c27f46de3859b09dea330a1935c2dca089f1d6f601fecb163198616.webp","width":78,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"朋永真季","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217809:130580:6351:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32517","characterName":"日方 奈夏","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"130581","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217809"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5005"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32517"},"originalCharacterName":"日方 奈夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【姉弟ハーレムをもくろむ、ハイスペック変態姉】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何をするにも自信まんまんなお姉ちゃん。次女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今をときめく売れっ子小説家で稼ぎで建てた豪邸をほったらかして、実家に入り浸る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その性癖は「両刀」にして「姉と弟どっちもラブ」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味を隠そうともせず、姉弟２人を口説きまくるため春乃からの鉄拳制裁を食らうこともしばしば。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふん。右手に姉、左手に弟はべらせて、スイートルームでシャンパン浴びるのがあたしの夢だからな」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5005","sourceWorkId":"17667","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"何をするにも自信まんまんなお姉ちゃん。次女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今をときめく売れっ子小説家で"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"稼ぎで建てた豪邸をほったらかして、実家に入り浸る。"},{"spoiler":false,"